            "review_title": "Review at Atrium Lounge",
            "review_text": "AdibPeb\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam586 contributions\n0\nSpacious , Comfortable, Quiet\nSep 2019 • Family\nThe atrium lounge in the Renaissance hotel Saigon is comfortable, spacious , quiet and relaxing .the food is reasonably priced but the beer is horribly expensive. \nService is very good especially by Sophie .\nWritten September 29, 2019\nrhisgnbrexecsec\nDear AdibPeb, \n\nMany thanks for sharing your experience from your recent visiting our Atrium Lounge. \n\nAtrium Lounge is located at the 5th floor. Its design is unique among other hotels in town with the atrium rising 21 floors above. It is a wonderful place that our guests shall experience a cosy atmosphere that the lounge offer. Great that you enjoyed relaxing time at our lounge and you like our concept. Many thanks for your compliment to Sophie and I will ensure to convey your praise to her. \n\nIt is our pleasure to serve you and we look forward to welcoming you back in the near future. \n\nGao Le\nDirector of Operations\nRenaissance Riverside Hotel Saigon\nRead more\nWritten November 18, 2019\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
