            "review_title": "Review at Atrium Lounge",
            "review_text": "SHADIADNAN\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam227 contributions\n0\nScones like no other\nSep 2015\nCozy and high end are two main aspects of this lounge located at the fifth floor of Renaissance Riverside Saigon hotel. Redeem your Hi Tea certificate as an esteemed Club Marriott user.\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 26, 2015\nRenaissance Riverside Hotel Saigon\nDear SHADIADNAN,\n\nThank you for becoming a Club Marriott member and enjoying Atrium Lounge. We always try to make guests feel like home and served with 5-star luxury. \n\nYour comment about our facilities and comfort are really motivating for us to keep up our quality standard. Once again, thank you for choosing Marriott and we do hope that you will think of us again should you travel to Ho Chi Minh City again in the near future.\n\nWarm Regards,\nHoang N.\nAtrium Lounge Manager\nRenaissance Riverside Saigon\nRead more\nWritten September 29, 2015\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
