            "review_title": "Review at Atrium Lounge",
            "review_text": "GuernseyDonkey11111\nSt Peter Port, United Kingdom15 contributions\n0\nexcellent business lounge style area\nJul 2015 • Couples\n5th floor of the hotel. Enclosed quiet lounge with excellent service.Ideal high quality place to meet people for work , or relax as a resident\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten July 20, 2015\nRenaissance Riverside Hotel Saigon\nDear GuernseyDonkey1111,\n\nThank you for sharing your recent experience at Atrium Lounge. We work really hard to exceed guest’s expectation and are so happy that you enjoyed the calm area as well as a superb service. We are proud of our true hospitality from the heart and your comment really motivates us to do even better. \n\nWe hope you will have an opportunity to visit us again in the near future.\n\nWarm Regards,\nHoang N.\nAtrium Lounge Manager\nRenaissance Riverside Saigon\nRead more\nWritten July 23, 2015\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
