            "review_title": "Review at Atrium Lounge",
            "review_text": "Frank M\n2 contributions\n0\nVery nice atmosphere. Wish Poolside Terrace could match.\nJun 2014 • Friends\nLove this place for a quick bite to eat or a nightcap cocktail before bed. The staff is very attentive and the music selection is great, whether it be live or playing music. Great chill place but it is in the middle of the Renaissance hotel with rooms very near by so it is not open late. My one complaint about this hotel is the atmosphere of the pool area. It makes me want to fall asleep, not have a drink and swim. Somebody, please kill the Kenny G music. I have been coming here for almost two years and the same lounge CD's keep playing over and over again. Please move Atrium atmosphere to pool as well. Staff is always a pleasure to be around in this hotel.\nRead more\nWritten June 14, 2014",
